{q: "Samuel Beckett, the voice of waiting and emptiness, belongs to which period?", a: "Postmodern Period", pool: "period", st: "Samuel Beckett belongs to the Postmodern Period.", fact: "বেকেটের নাটকে কিছুই ঘটে না, তবু সেই শূন্যতাই সবচেয়ে বড় ঘটনা।", u: 5}
